  "description": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B (revision 2fc06364) chat generation in-process on ONNX Runtime GenAI 0.17.1: Qwen35ChatModel over the model definition Starlings.Models.Qwen35 (the pinned chat template rendered in C#, the tool-call parser, prompt ids from the owned tokenizer Starlings.Tokenizers profile qwen35-bpe-chat: no Microsoft.ML.Tokenizers, no GenAI tokenizer) and Starling's decode loop (greedy or seeded sampling, stop tokens and strings, streaming, cancellation between steps, usage). Ships the asset lock of the ONNX Runtime GenAI bundle, not the weights. Profiles qwen3.5-0.8b/ortgenai-fp32x (CPU; CUDA with TF32 off) and ortgenai-fp16x (CUDA), Linux x64, Stable. The application adds Microsoft.ML.OnnxRuntimeGenAI or Microsoft.ML.OnnxRuntimeGenAI.Cuda. Maturity is per model profile (Stable, Preview or Experimental): see the README, generated from the model registry.",
